## Internal Linking Strategy
* Pillar Blog → Burgers Blog → Shawarma Blog → Late-Night Food Blog → Customer Favorites Blog → Family Restaurant Blog
* Each supporting blog links back to the main pillar page and related restaurant content.

## SEO Strategy
* Target restaurant and food-related keywords
* Create easy-to-read and engaging food content
* Optimize headings and keyword placement
* Publish consistent restaurant and food blogs
* Use FAQs and menu-based structured content
* Improve mobile responsiveness and local SEO visibility

